---
// Shapley by orderings, the smallest case: two features that only matter together.
// Numbers: f = 0.2 * momentum * value, stock D (1.41, 0.51), baseline (0, 0). Computed in Python:
// 0.2*1.41*0.51 = 0.1438; each feature gets 0.1438 / 2 = 0.0719.
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
const W = 900;
const H = 350;
const rows = [
  { y: 96, first: 'momentum', f1en: '12-month momentum', f1vi: 'Momentum 12 tháng', f2en: 'value', f2vi: 'value', a: 0.0, b: 0.1438 },
  { y: 196, first: 'value', f1en: 'value', f1vi: 'value', f2en: '12-month momentum', f2vi: 'momentum 12 tháng', a: 0.0, b: 0.1438 },
];
---
<figure class="atp09-so">
  <div class="atp09-so-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Two features that only work together share a payout of 0.1438. If momentum joins first it adds 0 and value then adds 0.1438; if value joins first it adds 0 and momentum then adds 0.1438. Averaged over the two orders, each feature gets 0.0719.">
      <text x="20" y="26" class="h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Fair split: try every order the features can join</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Chia công bằng: thử mọi thứ tự các feature vào cuộc</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="20" y="48" class="sub">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Say the score is 0.2 × momentum × value. Stock D: momentum 1.41, value 0.51. An average stock sits at 0 on both.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Giả sử điểm = 0,2 × momentum × value. Cổ phiếu D: momentum 1,41, value 0,51. Cổ phiếu trung bình nằm ở 0 cả hai.</tspan>
      </text>

      {rows.map((r, i) => (
        <g>
          <text x="20" y={r.y - 12} class="ord">
            <tspan data-lang-en>{`Order ${i + 1}`}</tspan>
            <tspan data-lang-vi>{`Thứ tự ${i + 1}`}</tspan>
          </text>
          <rect x="20" y={r.y} width="250" height="56" rx="6" class="step" />
          <text x="34" y={r.y + 24} class="sb">
            <tspan data-lang-en>{`${r.f1en} joins first`}</tspan>
            <tspan data-lang-vi>{`${r.f1vi} vào trước`}</tspan>
          </text>
          <text x="34" y={r.y + 44} class="num">
            <tspan data-lang-en>adds 0.0000</tspan>
            <tspan data-lang-vi>thêm 0,0000</tspan>
          </text>
          <polygon points={`282,${r.y + 24} 282,${r.y + 32} 306,${r.y + 32} 306,${r.y + 38} 320,${r.y + 28} 306,${r.y + 18} 306,${r.y + 24}`} class="arr" />
          <rect x="332" y={r.y} width="270" height="56" rx="6" class="step" />
          <text x="346" y={r.y + 24} class="sb">
            <tspan data-lang-en>{`${r.f2en} joins second`}</tspan>
            <tspan data-lang-vi>{`${r.f2vi} vào sau`}</tspan>
          </text>
          <text x="346" y={r.y + 44} class="num is-key">
            <tspan data-lang-en>adds 0.1438</tspan>
            <tspan data-lang-vi>thêm 0,1438</tspan>
          </text>
        </g>
      ))}

      <rect x="640" y="84" width="240" height="190" rx="8" class="res" />
      <DiagramIcon name="scale" x={668} y={112} size={24} />
      <text x="694" y="118" class="sb">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Average over orders</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Trung bình các thứ tự</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="660" y="158" class="sb">
        <tspan data-lang-en>momentum: (0 + 0.1438) / 2</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>momentum: (0 + 0,1438) / 2</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="660" y="182" class="big">
        <tspan data-lang-en>0.0719</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>0,0719</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="660" y="220" class="sb">
        <tspan data-lang-en>value: (0.1438 + 0) / 2</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>value: (0,1438 + 0) / 2</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="660" y="244" class="big">
        <tspan data-lang-en>0.0719</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>0,0719</tspan>
      </text>

      <text x="20" y="316" class="n">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Neither feature does anything alone, so neither can claim the whole 0.1438.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Không feature nào tự làm được gì, nên không feature nào nhận được cả 0,1438.</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="20" y="336" class="n">
        <tspan data-lang-en>SHAP does this averaging for every feature, over the real background data.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>SHAP làm đúng phép lấy trung bình này cho mọi feature, trên dữ liệu nền thật.</tspan>
      </text>
    </svg>
  </div>
</figure>

<style>
  .atp09-so { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .atp09-so-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .atp09-so svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .atp09-so text { fill: var(--text-body); font-size: 14px; }
  .atp09-so .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .atp09-so .sub { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .atp09-so .ord { font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .atp09-so .sb { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 600; fill: var(--text); }
  .atp09-so .num { font-size: 13.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .atp09-so .num.is-key { fill: var(--gold-icon); font-weight: 700; }
  .atp09-so .big { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--gold-icon); }
  .atp09-so .n { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .atp09-so .step { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .atp09-so .res { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .atp09-so .arr { fill: var(--text-muted); }
</style>
